# Registers the admin /admin/whats-on-test section in the e2e/test-mode
# bundle so it can
# be exercised and screenshotted locally and in CI. VITE_COMMIT_SHA stays
# unset here, so the page shows its deterministic "unknown build" fallback
# instead of calling the live GitHub API from tests — which is what the
# visual-review workflow's build wants, since e2e/screenshots.mjs mocks
# nothing. The playwright run builds its own bundle with a fake head sha
# (E2E_COMMIT_SHA in playwright.config.ts) so admin-whats-on-test.spec.ts
# can drive the deployed-build states with every request intercepted.
VITE_SHOW_TEST_STATUS=true
